WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.280
So we're doing volume one and each week we are simply continuing from last week

2
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:10.860
because this is a continuous text and they part of the text that we're actually

3
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:16.400
dealing with which is very early stage. Louisa is remembering how the Lord brought

4
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.840
her into this extraordinary relationship with him and she is recording the

5
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:28.680
difficulties that she had along the way. Now volumes one to four are the foundations

6
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:33.760
of the whole life in the divine will. It's like the foundations of a house.

7
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:39.200
Volume five to ten is like building the walls of the house. Volumes eleven and

8
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.840
twelve are like putting the roof on and all the other volumes are like changing

9
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:48.840
a house into a home and building your garden and making the whole thing

10
00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:53.520
completely livable. And I always give that image because it helps you to

11
00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:58.440
understand that you can't skip any volumes. There's lots of people who think I don't

12
00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:03.120
need the beginning. I'm not a newcomer to the spiritual life. But the thing is

13
00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:07.880
that the divine will spirituality is the crown and completion of all

14
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:12.760
spirituality so you can't come unless you have a great deal of spirituality

15
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.720
behind you and then you become a beginner in divine will. So this is like saying

16
00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:21.320
you've done your primary school, you've done your secondary school, now you're

17
00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.720
into the university and so you start as a beginner in the university even though

18
00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:32.200
you finished in your secondary school as somebody who was completing. So this is

19
00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:38.200
the highest level that Jesus says he wants to bring us to. So Louisa begins to

20
00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:43.120
talk about the privation that she suffers and she really had great

21
00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:48.560
difficulty with it. The privation was this is just for people who have just

22
00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:54.360
joined us. You and I have to live by faith. I presume you haven't seen visions

23
00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:57.840
and had revelations and all the rest of it so you wouldn't understand what

24
00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:02.720
privation was. But a person who goes into very very deep prayer and has known

25
00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:09.160
communion with God and has reached union with God has got used to a very very

26
00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:14.560
close communion with God and if you've never tasted it you have no idea what

27
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:20.440
you're missing because one instant of it is worth ten lifetimes. I mean one

28
00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:25.960
instant I'm not saying one minute, one instant of it is worth ten lifetimes.

29
00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:35.680
Louisa had this 24/7 365. Not only that but the Lord was appearing to her almost

30
00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:39.720
every day, initially almost every day and then it goes on to every single day and

31
00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:44.440
then many times a day. Now this is so completely off the richter scale for

32
00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:49.720
everybody else that we have no way of measuring the pain that she would have

33
00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:56.520
because the problem is that if you see heaven you don't want earth. The reason

34
00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:00.720
why the Lord doesn't show himself to us is that he wants us to have a pilgrimage

35
00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:05.200
time on the earth. He sent us to the earth to learn a whole lot of lessons. I

36
00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:10.120
hope you've learned them and we're supposed to get our PhD in certain

37
00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:14.520
lessons. All of us have certain things we have to learn. It's a journey he has

38
00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:21.400
sent us on and we must complete the journey so we all are moving and in the

39
00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:27.920
divine will what he does is instead of trekking the mountains in spirituality

40
00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:31.640
you then got a helicopter and if you went any higher you got an ordinary

41
00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:36.760
airplane but in the divine will he actually catapults you into the sky.

42
00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:41.200
It's like putting a rocket into and he brings you all to a level that nobody

43
00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:47.840
else has. So if you're at this level the pain that Louisa had Jesus explains in

44
00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:53.480
the higher volumes was the pain of parketry. Souls who have seen God and they

45
00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.280
can't have him for the moment. They can't have him in fullness for the moment.

46
00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:03.160
He also told her at one stage that she had experienced hell as well and that

47
00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:08.840
is the total deprivation of God after you've seen him because that's actually

48
00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:14.840
what hell is. Whether you describe it as fire or anything else they're only

49
00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:20.300
descriptions but the real pain is that you've seen God and you cannot be

50
00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:25.080
without him because you were created for him and you were created for that

51
00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:30.760
extraordinary love that exists between God and each one of us. So we want to

52
00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:35.560
pick up with Louisa talking about days of deprivation and she'll tell you

53
00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:40.160
what this awful pain she has. You just have to accept it because you will not

54
00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:44.560
have experienced it yourself. In this way she said I would spend sometimes two

55
00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:50.680
days sometimes four more or less that is deprived of him as he pleased. I'm taking

56
00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:57.960
up from last time. This is where I stop. What page is it for you? Sixteen. In the

57
00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:07.040
book is page 16. My only comfort she said was to receive him in the sacrament.

58
00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:12.600
Now this is a translation from Italian and the translator is talking as if

59
00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:17.200
there's only one sacrament. So you have to put your pen through it and put the

60
00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:23.440
Holy Eucharist on top because there are seven sacraments. Yes, certainly I found

61
00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:28.200
him there. I couldn't doubt it. And I remember only a few times he would not

62
00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:33.200
let himself be heard. So even in the deprivation she's hearing him even if

63
00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:36.720
she doesn't see him. So this is a level of communion with God that the rest of

64
00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:41.000
snow nothing about. She said because I prayed him and prayed him and

65
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.800
importumed him so much that he would make me content. Now do you hear her

66
00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:51.560
saying I kept praying on till he answered. There's a very good example of

67
00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:57.560
that in Luke chapter 18 the woman and the unjust judge. Do you remember? So it's

68
00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:03.720
actually Luke 18. But when Jesus teaches about prayer in Luke chapter 11 he

69
00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:10.320
tells you to persist. He tells you to persist. Keep at it. Because he will

70
00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:15.040
explain as we go along in these volumes that very often God doesn't answer your

71
00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:19.600
prayer simply because he wants you to pray it at a deeper level. You're praying

72
00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:24.560
too superficially. If you've reared children you know the difference between

73
00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:30.920
a child saying I want a biscuit because they've seen a packet of biscuits and a

74
00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:36.960
cry where a child has real need. So you jump over anything to get them with a

75
00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:41.000
real cry. Now the Lord says that one of the reasons why he doesn't answer our

76
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:45.880
prayers immediately is that the cry isn't deep enough. It's now actually coming

77
00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:49.960
from our innermost being. Now our Lady in Midgory has underlined that as well and

78
00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:54.400
she said pray from the heart. Pray from the heart not just from the lips. So

79
00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:59.280
there's Louisa saying that she absolutely insisted until he responded.

80
00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:04.080
The thing is the Lord doesn't mind you persisting in prayer. He actually likes

81
00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:10.080
it because he says to himself because somebody really wants me. You know we've

82
00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:13.000
got all these people saying prayers because they have to say them and here's

83
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:18.040
somebody who actually wants me. That makes a big difference doesn't it? So she

84
00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:22.200
said I would spend those days in that state described above. I would feel him

85
00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:27.720
come back within me especially if I had been faithful to him. Now she's

86
00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:32.680
underlying something there that's actually very important. The more faithful we are

87
00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:37.200
to the Lord the deeper and the better and the quicker he will respond to

88
00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:41.880
anything. But it's the same with us in relationships as well. If a person is

89
00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:46.120
really close to us and really faithful to us we respond pretty quick as well.

90
00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:50.320
And the person is not really in good relationship with us. We're not all that

91
00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:56.080
quick to respond are we? Now don't forget we are made like God and the Lord has

92
00:07:56.080 --> 00:08:00.360
told me that if you want to explain things spiritually look to your own

93
00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:04.200
relationships in marriage and outside of marriage and you'll get an awful lot of

94
00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:11.040
the answers as to how he responds to us because we were made like him. So he

95
00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:14.640
spoke to me more clearly and since during the previous days I had not been

96
00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:18.200
able to conceive one word or feel anything within me because she was in

97
00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:24.360
such pain. I came to know that it was not my fantasy what was going on. Now in

98
00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:29.400
volume one she's trying to discern all the time is the stuff that's happening to

99
00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:34.800
me really from God or not and it's very important for her to make that discernment.

100
00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:40.560
As I said to myself many times before so much so that of what has been said up

101
00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:45.240
here I would say nothing either to the confessor to any living soul. Now you have

102
00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:50.880
to get quite far into volume one before Louisa says something very simple. I never

103
00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:55.880
told my parents and she's living in the same house and she's spending most of her

104
00:08:55.880 --> 00:09:01.520
day in prayer. Can you imagine the pain of the parents with a teenager

105
00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:06.600
spending hours and hours and hours in their own room and the parents saying you

106
00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.600
know she's not being sociable she's not reaching out to anybody else. So their

107
00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:15.400
pain comes into this eventually because she has to deal with the parents

108
00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:20.560
eventually but she's actually quite far on in her relationship with God for she

109
00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:26.040
tells anybody. It's quite extraordinary. So when she says she didn't tell any

110
00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:31.560
other living soul she actually means it. But I did as much as I could to we would

111
00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:38.120
say respond to him but my translation always says correspond otherwise he would

112
00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:42.080
wage such a war against me that I'd have no peace. Now what she's referring to

113
00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.080
there is what we've already read in the pages before now and that is that he was

114
00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:51.600
guiding her very specifically into what she was to do. Our Lord she said you've

115
00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:57.600
been very good to me and I've been so bad so bad you mustn't take that on the

116
00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:02.360
dictionary level she's talking about in comparison with the extraordinary love

117
00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:06.080
and benevolence that's coming from God that the response that she's giving is

118
00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:12.000
not good enough. That's always the way with us. So continuing what I had started

119
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:16.760
I would feel him within me I would hug him I would clasp him to myself and I

120
00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:23.280
would say beloved good see how hard has been our separation and he would say to

121
00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:28.800
me what you have gone through is nothing yet prepare yourself for harder trials.

122
00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:35.160
Now I've read Dr. Valium 30 I haven't just got time to finish it at the

123
00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:41.480
moment but believe me this is nothing to us coming but the Lord is very good he'll

124
00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:46.760
always warn you he says you're only at the beginning this is nothing. This is

125
00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:52.560
why I have come he said to dispose your heart and strengthen it. Now this is

126
00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:58.400
extremely important that if we are to be able to open up to God in some new way

127
00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:03.200
we have to be disposed we have to be ready we have to be prepared and so

128
00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:08.000
he's saying to her that the experiences you're having now are actually preparing

129
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:13.200
you for what is to come and that's true of all of us. Now you will tell me

130
00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.000
everything you've gone through your doubts and your fears and all your

131
00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:20.940
difficulties so I may teach you how to behave in my absence. Now you're talking

132
00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:26.680
about a teenager relating to God and so at this very early stage she he allows

133
00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:33.480
her to tell him everything look like a young person talking to their father. Now

134
00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:38.400
the relationship between them is going to evolve as time goes on. So what he's

135
00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:43.440
saying is open your heart to me tell me everything and I will I will guide you.

136
00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:49.080
So the next thing she experiences is aridity in prayer. Now do you know what

137
00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:53.880
aridity in prayer is? You're doing fine and then all of a sudden one day you

138
00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:57.680
wake up and you couldn't get a prayer out if you even if somebody used a

139
00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:00.680
syringe to get it out you couldn't get it out you couldn't think a good thought

140
00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:08.040
because your soul and therefore your mind has gone into a state that's called

141
00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:13.800
aridity that's an inability to pray. Everybody gets that experience it's

142
00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:18.300
terribly important to know how to handle it. The wrong thing to do is to

143
00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:24.300
stop praying. So I would make him the narration of my pains or we would say I

144
00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:29.240
tell him all about it. Lord you see without you I was unable to do anything

145
00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:39.280
good. Now that's John 15 5. John 15 5 put it in the side. John 15 5 says without

146
00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:44.800
me you can do nothing and the opposite of that you always have to put it with it

147
00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:53.360
is Philippians 4.13 Philippians 4.13 and Philippians 4.13 says that I can do

148
00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:57.800
all things in Christ who gives me the strength. So without him I can do nothing

149
00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:04.000
with him I can do anything he wants. And those two references are needed all

150
00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:11.240
over volume one. So the meditation I did it all distracted and ugly so much so

151
00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:15.080
that I didn't have the courage to offer it to him in communion. That's like

152
00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:18.080
saying you went down to the church to do an hour of saturation and you couldn't

153
00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:22.000
think of anything not a thing. The only thing that would come into your head was

154
00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.720
there wasn't religious. Now that's aridity and you get these awful

155
00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:29.920
distractions going with it. You have to learn how to deal with it. So she said I

156
00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:34.720
was unable to stay there for hours. It was not unusual for Louisa to pray for

157
00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:40.760
three or four hours as a stint. As when I would feel you I saw myself alone I had

158
00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:46.680
no one with whom to converse to talk. I felt completely empty. Now that's the

159
00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:51.880
real aridity and prayer. You just feel you're utterly useless you can do nothing.

160
00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:57.000
The pain of your absence made me feel mortal agonies. In other words she

161
00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:01.760
really suffered. My nature wanted to hurry up and to escape that to escape

162
00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:08.680
that pain. Now the reason why Louisa says that when when she suffers Jesus'

163
00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:15.000
privation that her nature that means her body actually begins to disintegrate.

164
00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:20.120
She's not actually exaggerating because she's sitting in a bed. She's doing

165
00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:25.480
nothing physical. She's eating practically nothing. She's doing very

166
00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:32.760
little sleep. So she's actually only maintained in life supernaturally. If the

167
00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:37.000
Lord wasn't actually giving her the life she wouldn't have it. So we have that

168
00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:41.680
phenomenon with people who live on the Eucharist as well. That if you don't give

169
00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:45.720
them the Eucharist they would actually physically die. And the church has had

170
00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:50.600
to learn that the hard way. So when Louisa says you know I'm losing my life or my

171
00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:55.640
life is fading away she's actually telling the truth. My nature wanted to

172
00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:00.440
hurry up and escape the pain. That means I wanted to die. More so since it seems to

173
00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:06.440
me that I did nothing but waste time. And then the fear that in coming back you

174
00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:11.240
might chastise me because I had not been faithful. So I didn't know what to do

175
00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:16.920
and it's a very early stage and it's wonderful to hear a confession like

176
00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:23.080
this out of a saint at a level that Louisa is at because we're supposed to

177
00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:27.680
study this and learn so that we can move from our distractions and our

178
00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:32.600
oridities to where she was because that's the reason why it's written. So it's

179
00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:37.880
wonderful she's able to describe it. And then the pain that the pain because you

180
00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:42.040
are offended continuously and I was unable to do those acts of

181
00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.560
reparation that you taught me before and those visits to the most holy

182
00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:50.320
sacrament for the different offenses you receive tell me then what should I have

183
00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:57.400
done? And he very my book says benignly very kindly instructing me. Now he's the

184
00:15:57.400 --> 00:16:02.360
teacher you see and if you put beside it he's going to give her a whole teaching

185
00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.200
on prayer now because that's what he's looking for.

186
00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:16.480
Deuteronomy 13, 32, 32, 15 and that says the Lord alone was her guide. There's so

187
00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:23.880
much scripture in this whole thing it's absolutely fascinating. So Jesus is now

188
00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:29.080
going to teach her about prayer and the reason why she was ordered to write it

189
00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:34.160
down is that all the rest of us would learn the lessons. She got it the first

190
00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:38.520
time but all the rest of us have to get it at some point. The first thing Jesus

191
00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:44.800
said is you were wrong to be disturbed. Now throughout the first four volumes

192
00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:50.720
Jesus says to Louisa continuously you must not be disturbed on the inside no

193
00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:55.520
matter what's happening on the outside. So we all have things that can disturb

194
00:16:55.520 --> 00:17:01.520
you or upset you or displease you or whatever in your daily life but if you

195
00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:07.840
let it disturb you on the inside you will find that you're going to be so

196
00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:14.040
disturbed you can't pray you can't calmly make decisions you can't use God's

197
00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:18.440
wisdom it really really affects you. Now I've been giving spiritual directions since

198
00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:24.560
1980 and when a person describes the difficulty that they're having what you

199
00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:29.760
say to them is where you're upset on the outside or the inside. If you're upset

200
00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:33.240
on the outside no problem that's like saying we're sitting in this house and

201
00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:38.920
there's a storm outside but we're okay but if the storm is on the inside of the

202
00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:43.280
house then we're all having problems because there's no escape and you're

203
00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:50.520
you become part of the problem so if you allow disturbance into your soul you're

204
00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:54.520
not able to make the contact with the Lord that you should be making. But you

205
00:17:54.520 --> 00:18:00.800
can have a hurricane on the outside and if your soul is peaceful and still you

206
00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:05.680
can continue a relationship with God no problem. Have I made that clear? That's

207
00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:10.720
actually terribly important. So he said you were wrong to be disturbed. Don't you

208
00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:15.720
know that I am the prince of peace. Philippians 4-7 is what I want you to

209
00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:22.200
